crohz  peak_width_microhz  information_criterion\n              30.0                0.0                  1010.0               300.0                   47.2\n\nminimum_velocity_scan v_max=30, v_min=0.05, freq=1010:\nEmpty DataFrame\nColumns: [max_velocity_cm_s, min_velocity_cm_s, peak_frequency_microhz, peak_width_microhz, information_criterion]\nIndex: []\n\nGlobal min IC=43.9 is from family: frequency_amplitude_scan\n  Params: v_max=20.0, v_min=0.0, freq=1010.0, width=300.0\n\n=== Key question: does rank-1 exist in candidate_spectrum? ===", "status": "completed", "is_async": false, "tool_use_id": "call_0384713fc3414ca59ae4f0b6"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:13:49.914232+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:13:59.509278+00:00"}}

