data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 406, "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "data": {"id": "bf1ef638-fcac-4f93-808a-7a0beed9c822", "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "kind": "text", "position": 401, "revision": 406, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "All factual errors confirmed. Now I have the correct values:\n- Item 4: Rank-1 params don't exist in candidate_spectrum; IC=43.9 is from different params\n- Item 5a: delta_IC ≤ 20 → 9 candidates (not 10)\n- Item 5b: A-B < 0.50 → 9 passes (not 10); A-C > 0.80 → 12 passes (not 14); B-C max = 0.998 (not 0.936)\n- Item 6: l=2 coupling increases then decreases, peaks at n=4\n\nNow let me delegate substantive analysis to sub-agents. Per the SKILL.md and delegation contract, I need to delegate before further main-side pipeline work. I'll spawn two independent sub-agents:\n\n1. **Sub-agent 1**: Independent FFT/periodicity analysis + LOO robustness (computationally heavy, independent executor)\n2. **Sub-agent 2**: Independent verification of spectral ranking + cross-model correlation (independent re-computation of core findings)\n\n"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:14:18.124874+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:14:20.023092+00:00"}}

