und in candidate_spectrum_comparison\n\n--- 1b: Candidate counts within delta_IC thresholds ---\nTotal candidates: 250\nCandidates with delta_IC <= 10: 4\nCandidates with delta_IC <= 20: 9\n\nWithin delta_IC <= 10:\n  Rank 1: delta_IC=0.0\n  Rank 2: delta_IC=2.0\n  Rank 3: delta_IC=5.7\n  Rank 4: delta_IC=9.4\n\nWithin delta_IC <= 20 (additional beyond 10):\n  Rank 5: delta_IC=11.9\n  Rank 6: delta_IC=16.4\n  Rank 7: delta_IC=17.1\n  Rank 8: delta_IC=18.5\n  Rank 9: delta_IC=19.3\n\n--- 1c: Relationship between ranked_full_parameter_grid.tsv and candidate_spectrum_comparison.tsv ---\nUnique combos in ranked_full_parameter_grid: 250\nUnique combos in candidate_spectrum_comparison: 507\nOverlap (same param combos): 29\nFamilies in candidate_spectrum_comparison: {'frequency_amplitude_scan', 'minimum_velocity_scan'}\nCounts per family: {'frequency_amplitude_scan': 304, 'minimum_velocity_scan': 203}\nAll ranked combos in candidates: False\nAll candidates in ranked: False\nCONCLUSION: The two files represent OVERLAPPING but DIFFERENT candidate pools\n\nGlobal minimum IC across all candidates: 43.9\nOverlap entries: 29\nExact matches (delta == IC - global_min_ic): 0\n\nSample overlap entries (combo, delta, IC, IC-global_min):\n  (20.0, 0.0, 1010.0, 300.0): delta=43.9000, IC=43.9000, IC-min=0.0000, diff=43.900000\n  (30.0, 0.0, 1010.0, 300.0): delta=47.2000, IC=47.2000, IC-min=3.3000, diff=43.900000\n  (30.0, 0.03, 1210.0, 300.0): delta=50.7000, IC=50.7000, IC-min=6.8000, diff=43.900000\n  (20.0, 0.0, 1060.0, 300.0): delta=56.7000, IC=56.7000, IC-min=12.8000, diff=43.900000\n  (30.0, 0.0, 1060.0, 300.0): delta=57.3000, IC=57.3000, IC-min=13.4000, diff=43.900000\n\n--- 1d: Uniform alternative comparison ---\nBest uniform velocity: 0.1 cm/s\nBest uniform IC: 1522.1\nBest structured IC: 43.9\nIC difference (structured - uniform): -1478.1999999999998\n\nStructured IC range: [43.9, 13553.2]\nUniform IC range: [1522.1, 13553.2]\nDo ranges overlap? True\n\n========================