data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 962, "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "data": {"id": "fc837de5-8cf6-4888-a725-b26ad27447ba", "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "kind": "text", "position": 962, "revision": 962, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Key findings from the sub-agents:\n\n1. **FFT results**: Top peak frequencies are in the 100,000+ μHz"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:17:45.959615+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:17:45.959620+00:00"}}

id: 963
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 963, "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "data": {"id": "fc837de5-8cf6-4888-a725-b26ad27447ba", "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "kind": "text", "position": 962, "revision": 963, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Key findings from the sub-agents:\n\n1. **FFT results**: Top peak frequencies are in the 100,000+ μHz range (not near 1010-1060 μHz), and they vary widely across passes — no consistent periodic signal at the spectral peak frequency.\n2. **LOO results**: pass_01 has"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:17:45.959615+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:17:46.477496+00:00"}}

id: 964
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 964, "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "data": {"id": "fc837de5-8cf6-4888-a725-b26ad27447ba", "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "kind": "text", "position": 962, "revision": 964, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Key findings from the sub-agents:\n\n1. **FFT results**: Top peak frequencies are in the 100,000+ μHz range (not near 1010-1060 μHz), and they vary widely across passes — no consistent periodic signal at the spectral peak frequency.\n2. **LOO results**: pass_01 has a massive impact — removing it changes std by -21% to -42% across all models, exceeding the 10% threshold. Other passes have minimal impact (<5%).\n3. **Verification confirmed**: delta_IC ≤ 20 → 9 candidates; A-B < "}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:17:45.959615+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:17:46.996896+00:00"}}

id: 967
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 967, "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "data": {"id": "fc837de5-8cf6-4888-a725-b26ad27447ba", "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "kind": "text", "position": 962, "revision": 967, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Key findings from the sub-agents:\n\n1. **FFT results**: Top peak frequencies are in the 100,000+ μHz range (not near 1010-1060 μHz), and they vary widely across passes — no consistent periodic signal at the spectral peak frequency.\n2. **LOO results**: pass_01 has a massive impact — removing it changes std by -21% to -42% across all models, exceeding the 10% threshold. Other passes have minimal impact (<5%).\n3. **Verification confirmed**: delta_IC ≤ 20 → 9 candidates; A-B < 0.50 → 9 passes; A-C > 0.80 → 12 passes; B-C range [0.489, 0.998].\n\nNow let me fix Finding 4 in Result.md. Let me read the current state:\n\n"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:17:45.959615+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:17:47.559866+00:00"}}

