id: 990
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 990, "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "data": {"id": "55d193b9-8401-436f-b6c1-4d5093ded80c", "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "kind": "text", "position": 989, "revision": 990, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "The FFT/LOO agent has completed. Key findings:\n\n1. **FFT**: No consistent signal near 1010 μHz — top peaks are at 12,500–487,500 μHz (harmonic artifacts of uniform sampling)\n2. **LOO**: pass_01 is a strong outlier — removing it"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:18:03.637502+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:18:04.158603+00:00"}}

id: 991
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 991, "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "data": {"id": "55d193b9-8401-436f-b6c1-4d5093ded80c", "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "kind": "text", "position": 989, "revision": 991, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "The FFT/LOO agent has completed. Key findings:\n\n1. **FFT**: No consistent signal near 1010 μHz — top peaks are at 12,500–487,500 μHz (harmonic artifacts of uniform sampling)\n2. **LOO**: pass_01 is a strong outlier — removing it changes std by -21% to -42% across all models\n3. **Cross-pass consistency**: Rank-1 params don't exist in candidate_spectrum; IC values"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:18:03.637502+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:18:04.665812+00:00"}}

id: 993
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 993, "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "data": {"id": "55d193b9-8401-436f-b6c1-4d5093ded80c", "run_id": "run_6be133d109564be9", "kind": "text", "position": 989, "revision": 993, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "The FFT/LOO agent has completed. Key findings:\n\n1. **FFT**: No consistent signal near 1010 μHz — top peaks are at 12,500–487,500 μHz (harmonic artifacts of uniform sampling)\n2. **LOO**: pass_01 is a strong outlier — removing it changes std by -21% to -42% across all models\n3. **Cross-pass consistency**: Rank-1 params don't exist in candidate_spectrum; IC values are computed over all passes combined\n\nThis is critical for Finding 1 and Finding 2. Let me now update the report with these reconciled findings. First let me read the current state of Finding 1 and Finding 2:\n\n"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:18:03.637502+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:18:04.914859+00:00"}}

